            and a target-heart-rate program. Choose a NordicTrack or ProForm only if you want iFIT&rsquo;s ActivePulse to
            steer speed and incline for you.</strong>
          </p>
          <div class="not-prose overflow-x-auto my-8"><table class="min-w-[640px] w-full text-sm border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr>
